---
import { CONTACT_INFO } from '../data/products';
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
import WhatsAppIcon from './WhatsAppIcon.astro';
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <!-- Brand & Mission -->
      <div>
        <a href="/" aria-label="ArmXchange Home" style="display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          <Logo variant="light" size="lg" />
        </a>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.65; color: #94A3B8; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          <strong>ArmXchange</strong> is India’s specialized platform for competition shooting sports equipment. Founded by national-level shooter <strong>Pranatpal Singh</strong> (who recently started his coaching journey over the past year), our objective is to make equipment discovery authentic, verified, and accessible to every dedicated athlete.
        </p>
        <div>
          <span class="tech-badge" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); color: #E2E8F0;">
            {CONTACT_INFO.brandMotto}
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Categories -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="footer-heading">Equipment</h3>
        <ul class="footer-links">
          <li class="footer-link"><a href="/second-hand-weapons/">Second-Hand Weapons</a></li>
          <li class="footer-link"><a href="/new-weapons/">New Match Weapons</a></li>
          <li class="footer-link"><a href="/new-weapons/?sub=air-rifles">10m Air Rifles</a></li>
          <li class="footer-link"><a href="/new-weapons/?sub=air-pistols">10m Air Pistols</a></li>
          <li class="footer-link"><a href="/accessories/">Shooting Accessories</a></li>
          <li class="footer-link"><a href="/accessories/?sub=footwear">Match Boots & Shoes</a></li>
          <li class="footer-link"><a href="/pellets/">RWS Match Pellets</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Guide & Resources -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="footer-heading">Information</h3>
        <ul class="footer-links">
          <li class="footer-link"><a href="/how-it-works/">How ArmXchange Works</a></li>
          <li class="footer-link"><a href="/about-armxchange/">Our Story & Founder</a></li>
          <li class="footer-link"><a href="/pre-owned-equipment-guide/">Used Equipment Guide</a></li>
          <li class="footer-link"><a href="/contact/">Official Contact</a></li>
          <li class="footer-link"><a href="/legal/eligibility/">Shooter Eligibility & GST</a></li>
          <li class="footer-link"><a href="/legal/terms/">Terms of Service</a></li>
          <li class="footer-link"><a href="/legal/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Direct Contact -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="footer-heading">Direct Enquiries</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #94A3B8; line-height: 1.55;">
          Direct communication via verified WhatsApp & telephone consultation with founder:
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <a 
            href={`https://wa.me/${CONTACT_INFO.phoneRaw}?text=${encodeURIComponent('Hi Pranatpal, I would like to enquire about shooting sports equipment on ArmXchange.')}`}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn btn-whatsapp-solid"
            style="justify-content: space-between; padding: 11px 16px; font-size: 0.88rem; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px;"
          >
            <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;">
              <WhatsAppIcon size={18} />
              <span>Direct WhatsApp Consultation</span>
            </span>
            <span class="btn-trailing-icon">→</span>
          </a>
          <a 
            href={`tel:${CONTACT_INFO.phone}`}
            class="btn btn-secondary"
            style="justify-content: space-between; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.14); color: #FFFFFF; padding: 11px 16px; font-size: 0.88rem; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px;"
          >
            <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;">
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
              </svg>
              <span>Call Coach Pranatpal</span>
            </span>
            <span class="btn-trailing-icon">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: #94A3B8; font-family: var(--font-mono);">
          Phone: {CONTACT_INFO.phoneDisplay} &bull; Mon - Sat 9:00 AM - 7:00 PM IST
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Legal Compliance -->
    <div class="footer-disclaimer">
      <strong style="color: #E2E8F0; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.76rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em;">
        LEGAL & COMPLIANCE (INDIAN ARMS RULES 2016 / 0.177 CALIBRE):
      </strong>
      ArmXchange is an equipment discovery and athlete consultation platform. All featured air weapons are strictly competition-grade 0.177 calibre (4.5 mm) target pneumatics generating under 20 Joules of muzzle energy in accordance with Schedule I, Category III(f) of the Arms Rules 2016 (MHA, Government of India). We do not list, facilitate, or transfer cartridge firearms or restricted arms. An additional 18% GST applies for non-renowned shooters on brand-new imported weapons per prevailing Indian customs schedules. Shooter credential verification (NRAI / State Rifle Association) is conducted prior to equipment transfer.
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>© {currentYear} ArmXchange. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.76rem;">Precision 10m Competition Equipment</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
